{"id":"vod_bf_42540","vodId":"42540","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"樱子小姐的脚下埋着尸体","name_cn":"樱子小姐的脚下埋着尸体","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-43/b722642bf15533171cb71cf273b5fbfe.jpg"},"summary":"在寒冷的北海道旭川市某处，生活着以美人自居的大小姐九条樱子（伊藤静 配音）。除了有些自恋外，樱子还有用死尸骨头制作标本的怪癖，其对于验尸更有着较深的学识。也许正是对尸体、骨骼那有着近乎偏执的异乎寻常的喜爱，让樱子接二连三卷入各种匪夷所思的死亡事件中。在此过程中，普通高中生馆胁正太郎（榎木淳弥 配音）也被樱子牵着鼻子跑来跑去，见证着每一个案件被侦破的瞬间。对于死者来说，恰恰因为有了樱子这样的怪人，才让他们的冤屈得以昭雪……　　本片根据太田紫织的同名轻小说改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:07:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yingzixiaojiedejiaoxiamaizhuoshiti/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yingzixiaojiedejiaoxiamaizhuoshiti/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yingzixiaojiedejiaoxiamaizhuoshiti/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yingzixiaojiedejiaoxiamaizhuoshiti/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yingzixiaojiedejiaoxiamaizhuoshiti/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yingzixiaojiedejiaoxiamaizhuoshiti/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yingzixiaojiedejiaoxiamaizhuoshiti/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yingzixiaojiedejiaoxiamaizhuoshiti/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yingzixiaojiedejiaoxiamaizhuoshiti/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yingzixiaojiedejiaoxiamaizhuoshiti/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yingzixiaojiedejiaoxiamaizhuoshiti/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yingzixiaojiedejiao